      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_27bb65ee",
      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "observing_bodies_in_crematorium",
      "label": "U.S. soldiers observing bodies in a crematorium oven",
      "description": "A scene depicting U.S. soldiers examining human remains inside a crematorium oven. The soldiers are positioned around the oven, with one bending over to look inside and another standing nearby. The oven is built into a brick wall and contains charred bodies. The scene is framed by text overlays describing the context as 'the horrors of the Holocaust' and 'bodies stuffed into an oven in a crematorium'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
